{"nodes": [{"id": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_architecture_1000_sabords", "label": "Architecture du module 1000 Sabords", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "packages/module-mille-sabords/doc/technique/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_les_trois_couches", "label": "Les trois couches (h\u00f4te / \u00e9cran / domaine)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/module-mille-sabords/doc/technique/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le domaine ne conna\u00eet rien, l'\u00e9cran ne conna\u00eet que le domaine et le contrat, l'h\u00f4te n'est joignable qu'\u00e0 travers ModuleHost. Rien ne touche localStorage."}, {"id": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_module_de_comptage", "label": "Module de comptage (pas une application)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/module-mille-sabords/doc/technique/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le paquet n'a ni build, ni d\u00e9ploiement, ni stockage : joueurs, historique, stats, export, th\u00e8me et persistance restent \u00e0 l'h\u00f4te. Ce que le module poss\u00e8de, c'est le jeu."}, {"id": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_modulehost", "label": "ModuleHost (seule voie vers l'h\u00f4te)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/module-mille-sabords/doc/technique/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_test_differentiel_golden", "label": "Test diff\u00e9rentiel golden (preuve du portage)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "packages/module-mille-sabords/doc/technique/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le domaine est une transposition ligne \u00e0 ligne du Kotlin, v\u00e9rifi\u00e9e et non relue : tests/golden/ rejoue un corpus de parties des deux c\u00f4t\u00e9s et compare l'enveloppe v1.1 octet pour octet. Aucun des deux ne peut d\u00e9river sans que l'autre passe au rouge."}, {"id": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_oracle_kotlin", "label": "Oracle Kotlin legacy/1ksabord-kotlin", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "packages/module-mille-sabords/doc/technique/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gard\u00e9 temporairement comme oracle : ses 107 tests tournent en CI. Il dispara\u00eetra avec les d\u00e9p\u00f4ts satellites ; les fixtures golden restent."}, {"id": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_index_ts_export_minimal", "label": "index.ts n'exporte que le manifeste et le module", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "packages/module-mille-sabords/doc/technique/architecture.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Le registre de Scoreo l'importe de fa\u00e7on eager : tout ce qu'index.ts r\u00e9-exporterait voyagerait dans le bundle principal de l'h\u00f4te. Le domaine se rejoint par chemin relatif."}], "edges": [{"source": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_architecture_1000_sabords", "target": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_architecture_les_trois_couches", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "packages/module-mille-sabords/doc/technique/architecture.md", "source_location": "Les trois couches", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "packages_module_mille_sabords_doc_technique_ar